{{Term/Store|Hearty Truffle|Hearty Truffles|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Spoils"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Hearty Truffle}}
Hearty Truffles can be found below [[Tree]]s in the [[Great Hyrule Forest]] and [[Hyrule Field]]. They can be purchased from establishments such as the [[Spore Store]] and the [[East Wind]] or from the [[Wandering Merchant]] [[Cambo]]. They can be eaten to restore two [[Heart]]s. When [[Cooking|Cooked]] in a [[Cooking Pot]], the resulting food will grant [[Link]] [[Extra Hearts]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> Hearty Truffles that are exposed to [[Fire]] turn into [[Toasted Hearty Truffle]]s. At the [[Kochi Dye Shop]], they can be used as an ingredient to create Black [[Dye]].

