==={{TotK|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract/TotK|Hearty Truffle}}
Hearty Truffles can now be found exclusively in clumps of dirt in [[Cave]]s and [[Well]]s instead of on the [[Surface]], and they are significantly more valuable due to their newfound rarity.<ref name="TotK Savrey"/><ref name="TotK Savrey 2"/> When eaten, they restore two of [[Link]]'s [[Heart]]s to his [[Life Gauge]], whereas when [[Cooking|Cooked]] into [[Meal]]s, they restore all of his Hearts and temporarily grant him [[Extra Hearts]].<ref name="TotK Inventory"/> Due to their black coloration, they are difficult to spot in the dark environments they are found in.<ref name="TotK Savrey 3"/> When exposed to [[Fire]]s or [[Scorching Climate]]s, they become [[Toasted Hearty Truffle]]s. At the [[Kochi Dye Shop]], they can be used to make Black [[Hateno Dye]]s.

When [[Fuse]]d to [[Weapon]]s, Hearty Truffles impart [[Bouncy]] properties onto them, causing the Weapons to launch struck [[Enemy|Enemies]] back slightly. [[Shield]]s with Truffles Fused to them cause [[Enemy|Enemies]] who are [[Parry|Parried]] to stumble slightly.

